      "name": "World Health Organization (WHO) Guidelines for Community Noise (1995)",
      "description": "Established guidelines used as a benchmark for acceptable hospital noise levels (recommends Lmax no more than 40 dB(A) at night, patient room Leq no more than 35 dB(A) day and 30 dB(A) night).",
