  "limitations": [
    "No known uniformity in the averaging time for Leq or sound level meter settings (slow/fast) in historical literature.",
    "Historical literature often lacks typical spectra or other noise measures like spectral quality, tonality, and time variance.",
    "Did not measure noise transmission through walls from one patient room to another.",
    "Only studied a single commercial personal communication device at the time.",
    "Sound quality of personal communication devices was not as good as overhead paging systems.",
    "Many hospital areas (e.g., operating rooms, emergency treatment facilities) were not yet studied."
  ],
